  "title": "Privacy-control scoping",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Privacy-control scoping</h2><p>Identify the appropriate scope and control considerations for a new customer platform.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f1\">Control concern with unnecessary collection</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f1\"><option value=\"Data minimization and purpose limitation\">Data minimization and purpose limitation</option><option value=\"Automatic audit assurance\">Automatic audit assurance</option><option value=\"Only server purchase cost\">Only server purchase cost</option><option value=\"No privacy concern\">No privacy concern</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f2\">Scope to evaluate for payment-card data</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f2\"><option value=\"Applicable PCI DSS requirements and other obligations\">Applicable PCI DSS requirements and other obligations</option><option value=\"Only a stock-exchange rule\">Only a stock-exchange rule</option><option value=\"No standards can apply\">No standards can apply</option><option value=\"PCI automatically replaces all privacy law\">PCI automatically replaces all privacy law</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f3\">HIPAA scoping approach</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f3\"><option value=\"Evaluate covered-entity, business-associate, and activity facts\">Evaluate covered-entity, business-associate, and activity facts</option><option value=\"Assume any health word establishes scope\">Assume any health word establishes scope</option><option value=\"Assume HIPAA never applies\">Assume HIPAA never applies</option><option value=\"Use only the server location\">Use only the server location</option></select></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f4\">Third-party processing response</label><select id=\"isc-m2-tbs4-f4\"><option value=\"Document responsibilities, safeguards, and oversight\">Document responsibilities, safeguards, and oversight</option><option value=\"Assume the vendor assumes all liability\">Assume the vendor assumes all liability</option><option value=\"Ignore contracts\">Ignore contracts</option><option value=\"Permit every secondary use automatically\">Permit every secondary use automatically</option></select></div></section>",
